From 26e41abdce40f06860a9ba3876c8e7fda0f904a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vince Welke <vince.welke@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 07:49:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Restore bomb-only mode (Progressive Bombs) from the kara
 branch

Bomb-only mode was half-ported during the GK refactor: only DamageClassCalc
survived, SpecialWeapons was org'd at $B0902F (PC 0x18102F, a typo for
$B0802F) and nothing ever raised SpecialWeaponLevel, so the mode could not
work. Port the rest from ardnaxelarak/z3randomizer branch "kara" (the base
rom the legacy site's bombs mode ran on):

- SpecialWeapons back at $B0802F (PC 0x18002F), matching the legacy writer
- item $C0 Progressive Bombs: receipt behavior raises SpecialWeaponLevel
  (capped at 4) and turns on infinite bombs; graphics, palette by level
- infinite bombs restored on load/spawn when bomb level > 0
- bomb-mode damage table (Damage_Table_Bombs, selected by SpecialWeapons
  bit 7), Trinexx/Sidenexx/hammer imperviousness rules
- bombs collide with Giant Moldorm tail, Trinexx body, Helmasaur King;
  Moldorm and Agahnim's barrier accept bombs
- B button detonates placed bombs
- menu/HUD/Y-box bomb level icons, bomb sprite color by level
- tablets readable with level 2 ("master") bombs, boss-kill stats by level

Non-bomb modes keep vanilla collision behavior.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
